## Model card

- **Name:** Claude Opus 4.5
- **Short description:** Anthropic’s legacy Opus 4.5 model for coding agents and complex tasks, now superseded by newer Opus models.
- **Provider / access:** Anthropic Claude API `claude-opus-4-5-20251101` (legacy). Local metadata lists `anthropic/claude-opus-4.5` and `noFreeId`.
- **Release / knowledge:** Released November 24, 2025 (Anthropic docs/announcement). Knowledge cutoff not fully specified in reviewed docs page.
- **IDs:** `claude-opus-4-5-20251101`, `claude-opus-4-5`.
- **Context window:** 200,000 tokens (platform docs).
- **Modalities:** Text and image input; text output (local metadata/docs context).
- **Pricing (as of 2026-11-10):** $5 / 1M input tokens, $25 / 1M output tokens (platform docs). Local metadata notes paid-tier pricing.
- **Architecture:** Proprietary Anthropic model; architecture/parameter count not publicly disclosed.

